Description: tray application that records meeting audio to Opus or WAV
 Recorder sits in the system tray (StatusNotifier) and records the
 microphone and, optionally, the system audio output on demand. Files are
 written as mono 48 kHz Ogg/Opus (or WAV) into a folder, ready for a
 speech-to-text model. It can start at login and keeps both audio streams
 aligned on the microphone's timeline.
